\section{Missing values}{

A missing metric (\code{NA}) usually means the value was \strong{suppressed} to
protect privacy (small counts), not that it is zero. Each dataset's
schema says which (\code{\link[=gcd_describe]{gcd_describe()}}), and \code{\link[=gcd_rows]{gcd_rows()}} prints the API's
advisory when a result holds suppressed values.
}

